      "content": "okay wow that sounds scary... but i dont really think it can be that bad? i mean i feel totally fine when im just sitting on the bench. it's probably just because i was stuck in a cramped seat for like 13 hours and my circulation is just a bit sluggish. maybe i should just grab a big bottle of water, take some ibuprofen for the swelling, and get a massage or something to help the leg? would that settle it down?",
